## 📚 API Reference

### ThroughputCalculator

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `CalculateThroughput()` | Core throughput calculation |
| `ValidateChain()` | Production chain validation |
| `GetBottlenecks()` | Bottleneck detection |
| `Simulate()` | Full simulation run |

